{"start":"t:body","attrs":{}}
{"text":"\n      "}
{"start":"t:div","attrs":{"corresp":"urn:x-opensiddur:text:siddur:rosh_hashanah/shofar/qera_satan","facs":"https://archive.org/download/mahzor-lyom-rishon-shel-rosh-hashanah-day-one-jenny-marmorstein-1965/page/n186.jpg"}}
{"text":"\n        "}
{"start":"t:p","attrs":{}}
{"start":"t:milestone","attrs":{"unit":"chapter","n":"3","corresp":"urn:x-opensiddur:text:siddur:rosh_hashanah/shofar/qera_satan/lamentations_3"}}
{"end":"t:milestone"}
{"start":"t:milestone","attrs":{"unit":"verse","corresp":"urn:x-opensiddur:text:siddur:rosh_hashanah/shofar/qera_satan/lamentations_3/56","n":"56"}}
{"end":"t:milestone"}
{"start":"t:seg","attrs":{"source":"urn:x-opensiddur:text:bible:lamentations/3/56"}}
{"text":"My voice hast Thou heard, do not hide Thine ear to my plea for relief, to my cry."}
{"end":"t:seg"}
{"tail":" "}
{"start":"t:milestone","attrs":{"unit":"verse"}}
{"end":"t:milestone"}
{"start":"t:milestone","attrs":{"unit":"chapter"}}
{"end":"t:milestone"}
{"start":"t:milestone","attrs":{"unit":"chapter","n":"119","corresp":"urn:x-opensiddur:text:siddur:rosh_hashanah/shofar/qera_satan/psalms_119"}}
{"end":"t:milestone"}
{"start":"t:milestone","attrs":{"unit":"verse","corresp":"urn:x-opensiddur:text:siddur:rosh_hashanah/shofar/qera_satan/psalms_119/160","n":"160"}}
{"end":"t:milestone"}
{"start":"t:seg","attrs":{"source":"urn:x-opensiddur:text:bible:psalms/119/160"}}
{"text":"The beginning of Thy word is truth, and Thy righteous judgment is for eternity."}
{"end":"t:seg"}
{"tail":" "}
{"start":"t:milestone","attrs":{"unit":"verse","corresp":"urn:x-opensiddur:text:siddur:rosh_hashanah/shofar/qera_satan/psalms_119/122","n":"122"}}
{"end":"t:milestone"}
{"start":"t:seg","attrs":{"source":"urn:x-opensiddur:text:bible:psalms/119/122"}}
{"text":"Grant Thy servant an assurance of good, that the arrogant shall not oppress me."}
{"end":"t:seg"}
{"tail":" "}
{"start":"t:milestone","attrs":{"unit":"verse","corresp":"urn:x-opensiddur:text:siddur:rosh_hashanah/shofar/qera_satan/psalms_119/162","n":"162"}}
{"end":"t:milestone"}
{"start":"t:seg","attrs":{"source":"urn:x-opensiddur:text:bible:psalms/119/162"}}
{"text":"I rejoice in Thy word like a man who has found abundant booty."}
{"end":"t:seg"}
{"tail":" "}
{"start":"t:milestone","attrs":{"unit":"verse","corresp":"urn:x-opensiddur:text:siddur:rosh_hashanah/shofar/qera_satan/psalms_119/66","n":"66"}}
{"end":"t:milestone"}
{"start":"t:seg","attrs":{"source":"urn:x-opensiddur:text:bible:psalms/119/66"}}
{"text":"Teach me good sense and knowledge for I believe in Thy commandments."}
{"end":"t:seg"}
{"tail":" "}
{"start":"t:milestone","attrs":{"unit":"verse","corresp":"urn:x-opensiddur:text:siddur:rosh_hashanah/shofar/qera_satan/psalms_119/108","n":"108"}}
{"end":"t:milestone"}
{"start":"t:seg","attrs":{"source":"urn:x-opensiddur:text:bible:psalms/119/108"}}
{"text":"Accept with favour the voluntary offerings of my mouth, O Lord, and teach me Thy judgments."}
{"end":"t:seg"}
{"tail":" "}
{"start":"t:milestone","attrs":{"unit":"verse"}}
{"end":"t:milestone"}
{"start":"t:milestone","attrs":{"unit":"chapter"}}
{"end":"t:milestone"}
{"end":"t:p"}
{"tail":"\n      "}
{"end":"t:div"}
{"tail":"\n    "}
{"end":"t:body"}
